[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3584919935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113218#issuecomment-3584919935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113218","id":3584919935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VrYl_","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T09:29:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T09:29:19Z","body":"`FUNCTION_STR` is already passed to `ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG`. What's the reason it doesn't end up in the printed error? It sounds like knowing the function name would be beneficial in all circumstances.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3584919935/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3590032151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113218#issuecomment-3590032151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113218","id":3590032151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7V-4sX","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-28T17:48:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T17:49:22Z","body":"> Sorry to block this PR, but I'd like confirmation what's happening to the `FUNCTION_STR` passed to `ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG`. Shouldn't we print the function the error is occurring in for all errors? This seems like highly relevant information for debugging / understanding what's causing a bug for all kinds of errors.\r\n\r\nIt looks like it's passed all the way down to the trace printed in gray, e.g. in UnixTerminalLogger:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7ed0b6167618f9c8c5df87c7e83da6003c081368/drivers/unix/os_unix.cpp#L1207\r\n\r\nIn fact, in `master`, the function name is already visible if you expand the error in the **Debugger > Errors** panel (`translate()` in this example):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"125\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b681eca-24ef-4b63-baa0-39c0cfad682a\" />\r\n\r\nThis trace isn't visible for errors printed to the Output panel though (only in stderr, if you've opened the editor from a terminal). However, this error is generally not printed to the Output panel, not even due to `@tool` scripts, as thread groups don't seem to be active while in the editor.\r\n\r\nEither way, making the function name more prominently visible for this particular case makes sense, so you don't need to expand the error every time.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3590032151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3591725958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113218#issuecomment-3591725958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113218","id":3591725958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WFWOG","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-29T14:45:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-29T14:45:46Z","body":"> I'd still argue that the function name is relevant in all error situations, and should be easily accessible. But thinking about it again, this may take a while to figure out how to do best. In the meantime, this is a nice usability improvement, so I guess it's fine to add it.\r\n\r\nThe bigger problem really is that the editor just kinda sucks at debugging and logging _its own errors_ in an easily accessible way. You can see the call stack for running projects in the Debugger dock, but not for the editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3591725958/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602076296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113218#issuecomment-3602076296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113218","id":3602076296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ws1KI","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T13:30:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T13:30:37Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3602076296/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]